          "description": "Unshaded downward-opening parabola with positive-direction axis arrows, arrows at both lower curve ends, selected labelled ticks and an unlabelled tick at 2. Source grey strokes use house black.",
          "mathematics": "y=1-x^2; vertex (0,1); roots -1 and 1; labelled x-values -1, 1/2, 1 and 3.",
